<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 12.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 12.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, May 12:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,500.10 (1,499.40)	CHF  1,054.00 (1,044.30)</p>
<p>    DEM    888.42 (881.95)	  GBP  2,436.30 (2,429.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    126.24 (125.32)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Saturday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.10 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$15.37 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $32.47 million ($49.12 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
